WIZARDHAT LOCK SENTINEL
=======================

This directory is sealed. Rules of the hat:

1. Every wizardhat script refuses to run if this sentinel is absent.
2. On startup, every agent re-asserts mode 0700 on .wizardhat/ (owner-only).
3. All wizardhat scripts, workflows, plans, and reports nest INSIDE this
   directory. Nothing leaks into the wider MacroHard tree.
4. `.gitattributes` here marks the entire directory `export-ignore`:
   it is excluded from every `git archive` bundle of this repository.
5. Honest limit: a directory inside a git repository cannot be more
   private than the repository itself. Within-repo privacy is enforced
   by convention (this sentinel + 0700 + export-ignore); true privacy
   is governed by the repository's visibility setting.

